mes hosmer he will score  and the padres have tied the game one to  one manny machado driving in the game  tying run right back up the middle for  machado that'll work a two out rbi just  playing a little game of pepper right  there just below the belt buckle and  beating the defense of correa just out  of the shortstop's reach so straw moves  to third springer's at second now two  ways at first and now it's correa he had  an rbi single his first time up base is  loaded for the second inning in a row  for the astros  swing and a miss and he struck him out  that is strikeout number three for  richards and two down here in the second  inning that's a doozy right there  ace is still loaded and josh redick 63  pitches 35 of them for strikes so far  for richards that hat is drenched yes it  is  another 3-2 count and another pitch by  garrett richards swinging in a miss  strike three  still a ball game what a veteran my gosh  you think guys in the clubhouse don't  see this and respect guys like that it's  tatis on second hosmer on first base for  machado mccullar is working hard now the  pitch curve ball and that's hit right at  toro at third he goes to altuve at  second on the first double play  what a turn and what a moment for the  astro as mccullers pumps his fist and  that'll do it for san diego here in the  third will myers the batter  look out that is a breaking ball that  backs into the helmet of will myers he  ducked down  and as he was losing his helmet that  pitch hit him he had nowhere to go that  get him in the back of the head  checking out his gear make sure it's  okay a very successful sacrifice punt by  greg garcia now the astros bring the  infield in against the switch hitter  jerks in profile  in the air to left field tucker going  back towards the track and tucker leaps  and makes the catch tagging in third is  cronenworth he will score  and tying it second and moving to third  is myers as the padre is taking a 2-1  lead on a sac fly for turrets of profar  in a very nice catch as you mentioned by  tucker out there two down in the fifth  and manny machado machado lines it into  left field for a base hit grisham coming  around trying to score the throw from  tucker is going to be cut off and the  padres take a 3-1 lead manny machado  driving in a run for san diego  second hit second rbi tonight for manny  machado from the worth has done the same  thing twice tonight that's watts  mccullars jr has been very careful in  dealing with him  in the air to right field springer going  back at the wall that ball is going to  be off the wall  machado is going to try and score all  the way from first base here's the throw  it will be  not in time machado's in and the padres  take a 4-1 lead  wall ball double for jake cronenworth  drives in manny machado all the way from  first and the padres lead it four to one  nice job running nice job sliding by  machado who ends up going feet first  into the plate umpire and then hugging  his leg  wanna bring up miles straw who is one  for two with an infield hit oh one and  that's hammered deep to left field it  sends back profile at the wall he can't  get it it's off the wall around third  jones he will score straw will take the  turn at second and stop there with an  rbi double and it is four to two padres  boy straw almost took him deep that's  back-to-back doubles now for the astros  i thought straw got him the padres who  had four grand slams in four consecutive  games have the bases loaded here with  two outs in the sixth inning and eric  hosmer did it last night can he do it  again the one two and that's grounded  hits off the glove of perez feel it by  correa spins foes got him at first oh  what a play by correa perez tipped that  with his glove slowed it down correa  fielded it behind second did a pirouette  and able to get hosmer to get the astros  out of the inning so it continues for  the left-handed hitting left fielder  kyle tucker who's already walked twice  tonight here's the pitch  and it is lined into center field and  that's a base hit a one hopper to  grisham altuve's gonna score toro around  second and makes it to third on the rbi  single by tucker and now the astros are  within one run it's four to three  that'll give abraham toro a chance  on the ground softly towards second base  it is garcia the first of the padres win  tonight they beat the astros 4-3 good  way to start this three-game weekend  series

